{
  "id": "E400",
  "title": "Fixed It A Bit",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-02-02",
  "synopsis": "Little Le is picking photos to be posted online, but she might have gone a bit overboard with the photoshopping…",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50400/f9de806d8d0fcf52157081e705d30b555b711914.mp3?1580203687",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我就修了一点\n\n小乐：这张照片怎么样？我想发到网上。\n保罗：这是谁？\n小乐：是我啊！你看不出来吗？\n保罗：我的妈呀！太假了。一点儿也不像你啊！\n小乐：还好吧，我就修了一点。\n保罗：一点？我都认不出你了。你还是换一张照片吧！",
    "traditional": "我就修了一點\n\n小樂：這張照片怎麼樣？我想發到網上。\n保羅：這是誰？\n小樂：是我啊！你看不出來嗎？\n保羅：我的媽呀！太假了。一點兒也不像你啊！\n小樂：還好吧，我就修了一點。\n保羅：一點？我都認不出你了。你還是換一張照片吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I only fixed it a bit"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：这张照片怎么样？我想发到网上。",
      "traditional": "小樂：這張照片怎麼樣？我想發到網上。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhè zhāng zhào piàn zěn me yàng wǒ xiǎng fā dào wǎng shang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: How about this photo? I want to post it online."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：这是谁？",
      "traditional": "保羅：這是誰？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zhè shì shéi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Who is this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：是我啊！你看不出来吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：是我啊！你看不出來嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shì wǒ a nǐ kàn bù chū lái ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: It’s me! Can’t you see that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：我的妈呀！太假了。一点儿也不像你啊！",
      "traditional": "保羅：我的媽呀！太假了。一點兒也不像你啊！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ de mā ya tài jiǎ le yì diǎn'r yě bú xiàng nǐ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Oh my God! It’s too fake. It doesn’t even look a bit like you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：还好吧，我就修了一点。",
      "traditional": "小樂：還好吧，我就修了一點。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hái hǎo ba wǒ jiù xiū le yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: It’s okay, I only fixed it a bit."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：一点？我都认不出你了。你还是换一张照片吧！",
      "traditional": "保羅：一點？我都認不出你了。你還是換一張照片吧！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó yì diǎn wǒ dōu rèn bù chū nǐ le nǐ hái shi huàn yì zhāng zhào piàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: A bit? I can’t even recognize you. You’d better change to another photo!"
    }
  ],
